<view class="page">
  <view class="title">给记录留个副本</view><view class="subtitle">账本属于你，也随时可以带走</view>
  <view wx:if="{{storageError}}" class="error">{{storageError}}</view>
  <view wx:else class="panel"><view class="row"><text>当前账单</text><text class="section-title">{{count}} 笔</text></view><view class="row"><text>资产与负债账户</text><text class="section-title">{{accountCount}} 个</text></view><view class="note">最近成功发送备份：{{backupTime}}</view><view wx:if="{{storageUsage}}" class="note">本地存储已用：{{storageUsage}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{capacityWarning}}" class="error">{{capacityWarning}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{protectionWarning}}" class="error">{{protectionWarning}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{storageError || protectionWarning}}" class="recovery-hint">可展开下方“高级恢复”检查本地保护副本。</view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">JSON 完整备份</view><view class="note">包含收支账单、资产与负债账户、金额历史、分类和设置。生成后再点击发送，保存到自己的文件传输助手或可靠的保存位置。</view>
    <button class="primary action" bindtap="exportJson" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">生成备份文件</button>
    <view class="note">仅生成文件不代表已完成设备外备份。备份包含真实金额，即使页面隐藏金额也不会加密。</view>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">最近一次手动备份</view>
    <view wx:if="{{!latestExport}}" class="note">暂无手动备份，可点击上方按钮生成。</view>
    <block wx:else>
      <view class="note file-name">{{latestExport.fileName}} · {{latestExport.sizeText}}</view>
      <block wx:if="{{latestExport.valid}}">
        <view class="note">生成时间：{{latestExport.savedText}} · {{latestExport.records}} 笔账单 · {{latestExport.accounts}} 个账户</view>
        <view class="note">账本时间：{{latestExport.updatedText}}</view>
        <block wx:if="{{pendingId === latestExport.id}}">
          <view class="note">{{sendStatus}}</view><view wx:if="{{sendError}}" class="error">{{sendError}}</view>
          <button class="primary action" bindtap="sendGenerated" disabled="{{busy}}">发送／重试发送</button>
        </block>
        <block wx:else><view class="note">本地文件已保留，发送状态未记录；请以聊天中收到的文件为准。</view><button class="primary action" bindtap="sendExport" data-id="{{latestExport.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">发送此备份</button></block>
      </block>
      <view wx:else class="error">{{latestExport.error}}。原文件保留，可在历史导出或高级恢复中查找其他副本。</view>
      <view class="link" bindtap="removeExport" data-id="{{latestExport.id}}">删除此文件</view>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{fileName && (sendFileType === 'csv' || sendFileType === 'assets')}}" class="panel">
    <view class="section-title">待发送 CSV 文件</view><view class="note file-name">{{fileName}}</view><view class="note">{{sendStatus}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{sendError}}" class="error">{{sendError}}</view><button class="primary action" bindtap="sendGenerated" disabled="{{busy}}">发送／重试发送</button>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <button class="secondary fold-button" bindtap="toggleHistory">历史导出 · {{historyExports.length}} 份 {{historyOpen ? '收起 ▴' : '展开 ▾'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{exportSizeText}}" class="note">手动导出的 JSON 共占用设备空间 {{exportSizeText}}，程序不会自动删除。设备文件空间用满后将无法继续保存，可在这里删除不需要的文件。</view>
    <block wx:if="{{historyOpen}}">
      <view class="note">保留以前手动生成的 JSON 文件。发送直接使用原文件，不会额外生成备份。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{!historyExports.length}}" class="note">暂无其他历史导出。</view>
      <button wx:else class="danger action" bindtap="removeHistory" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">删除全部历史导出（保留最近一份）</button>
      <view wx:for="{{historyExports}}" wx:key="id" class="candidate">
        <view class="file-name">{{item.fileName}} · {{item.sizeText}}</view>
        <block wx:if="{{item.valid}}">
          <view class="note">生成时间：{{item.savedText}} · {{item.records}} 笔账单 · {{item.accounts}} 个账户</view><view class="note">账本时间：{{item.updatedText}}</view>
          <view wx:if="{{pendingId === item.id}}" class="note">{{sendStatus}}</view><view wx:if="{{pendingId === item.id && sendError}}" class="error">{{sendError}}</view>
          <view class="row"><button class="secondary small-button" bindtap="sendExport" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">发送此备份</button><button class="secondary small-button" bindtap="recoverCandidate" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复此副本</button><button class="danger small-button" bindtap="removeExport" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">删除</button></view>
        </block>
        <block wx:else><view class="note">{{item.error}}；原文件仍保留。</view><button class="danger small-button" bindtap="removeExport" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">删除</button></block>
      </view>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view class="panel">
    <button class="secondary fold-button" bindtap="toggleRecovery">高级恢复 · {{recoveryCopies.length}} 项 {{recoveryOpen ? '收起 ▴' : '展开 ▾'}}</button>
    <block wx:if="{{recoveryOpen}}">
      <view class="note">这里是自动快照、设备自动备份及导入或升级前副本。检查不会修改账本。请核对时间和数量，先导出保存，再确认恢复。</view>
      <view wx:if="{{latestExport && latestExport.valid}}" class="candidate"><view>恢复最近一次手动备份</view><view class="note file-name">{{latestExport.fileName}}</view><button class="secondary action" bindtap="recoverCandidate" data-id="{{latestExport.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复此副本</button></view>
      <view wx:if="{{!recoveryCopies.length}}" class="note">未找到自动保护副本。</view>
      <view wx:for="{{recoveryCopies}}" wx:key="id" class="candidate">
        <view>{{item.label}}</view>
        <block wx:if="{{item.valid}}"><view class="note">账本时间：{{item.updatedText}} · {{item.records}} 笔账单 · {{item.accounts}} 个账户</view><view wx:if="{{item.savedAt}}" class="note">副本时间：{{item.savedText}}</view><view class="row"><button class="secondary small-button" bindtap="exportCandidate" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">导出副本</button><button class="secondary small-button" bindtap="recoverCandidate" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复此副本</button></view></block>
        <view wx:else class="note">{{item.error}}；此副本暂不可恢复，原文件仍保留。</view>
      </view>
      <button wx:if="{{hasSafety}}" class="secondary action" bindtap="undoRestore" disabled="{{busy}}">恢复导入前副本</button>
    </block>
  </view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">导出 CSV</view><view class="note">CSV 方便用 Excel 查看，不用于恢复账本。资产清单包含归档账户，不包含金额更新历史。</view><button class="secondary action" bindtap="exportCsv" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">导出全部账单</button><button class="secondary action" bindtap="exportAssets" disabled="{{busy || storageError}}">导出资产清单</button></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">从聊天文件恢复</view><view class="note">选择以前发送到微信聊天的 JSON 备份，支持 v1、v2、v3。恢复会整体替换当前数据，确认前请核对内容；旧版备份可能没有资产账户。</view><button class="secondary action" bindtap="importJson" disabled="{{busy}}">选择 JSON 备份</button></view>
  <view class="panel"><view class="section-title">检查与诊断</view><button class="secondary action" bindtap="inspectAll" disabled="{{busy}}">重新检查本地文件</button><button class="secondary action" bindtap="copyDiagnostics" disabled="{{busy}}">复制诊断摘要</button><view class="note">摘要包含版本、数量、时间、读写状态及本次发送错误，不含账单内容。</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="note">正在处理，请稍候…</view>
</view>
